{"name": "Soulflame", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/bf018978436b4fbc33d6bea0bc19831f.avif?t=1776390380\" width=\"1080\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Orphan Keira Eldrid lives alone with her sister in a small town on the edge of\u00a0the ancient forest. One day, on a short trip into the woods, something attacks the town she grew up in and kidnaps her sister.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>To get her back, Keira will\u00a0have to harness the power of the forest and master new abilities -- all while connecting with her inner self.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Soulflame</i> is a action adventure story set in a fantasy forest, filled with creatures from cute to terrifying. Partake in a 3-act adventure story where each act acts as it's own mini-metroidvania. Uncover lost history, learn new skills and platform your way to answers in this story about loss, revenge and acceptance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/ad731d0fccea5f2c5dc3ee8b8bd09ba4.avif?t=1776390380\" width=\"1080\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soulflame</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snappy side-scrolling platforming tailored just right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"724\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/6827e4efedc2ffcc5aa59db6912394c1.poster.avif?t=1776390380\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/6827e4efedc2ffcc5aa59db6912394c1.webm?t=1776390380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/6827e4efedc2ffcc5aa59db6912394c1.mp4?t=1776390380\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responsive melee combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"552\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/f9c4b7695c5672d8b7d7bc0b05e09444.poster.avif?t=1776390380\" width=\"870\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/f9c4b7695c5672d8b7d7bc0b05e09444.webm?t=1776390380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/f9c4b7695c5672d8b7d7bc0b05e09444.mp4?t=1776390380\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crisp hand-crafted pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/3dd76894372e9f0c5f4e308388b58844.poster.avif?t=1776390380\" width=\"1088\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/3dd76894372e9f0c5f4e308388b58844.webm?t=1776390380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177660/extras/3dd76894372e9f0c5f4e308388b58844.mp4?t=1776390380\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the past using Memory-fragments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tailor the gameplay to your style using Assist Mode</p></li><li><p clas